-- CompassEats, Nov 3 2026. Open items 1, 2, 3. Ben Nov 3 20:42 ET "1A, 2A, 3A, 4A, 5A, 6A". This file runs only after his "go".
-- 1A Masa: new venue, 13 rows and the price leave Bar Masa. 2A: printed-twice rows stay, with a URL (Gari 17234, 17232; Sushi Saito 18027). 3A: Yamasaki. 4A: new row OAD 2026 No. 773 on Tempura Yamanoue Ginza. 5A: Carmen Medellin keeps its name. 6A: Mitani and Yakitori Kurosaki active.
-- New venues 11 (10 active, Yama no Ue closed and not published). New city Prato. Kabuki Madrid moves Milan to Madrid. Carmen moves Lima to Medellin; non-canonical /lima/restaurante-carmen row does not change. City labels of the 2 moved venues do not change (what OAD printed).
-- Expected after: venues 11,336 (active 11,042, closed 294); awards 25,324; Michelin 2025 no URL 3,028; Michelin 2026 no URL 434; slugs 13,184 (non-canonical 1,848); listings 11,336; city labels 24,079;
--   cities 3,281, sum 11,042; redirects 13; price 7,759; rename_batches 33; rename_rows 1,398; ledger 211 rows; audit_log +104 (120,196 rows).
BEGIN;
DO $fix$
