    ('la-liste', 'award', 1, 'cleanup:fix-a2-a3-d-2026-11-03 | open item 1: 2666 moved to Masa; no URL, read from a copy of the list | Ben Nov 3 20:42 ET "1A, 2A, 3A, 4A, 5A, 6A"'),
